### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "user1",
    "email": "user1@gmail.com",
    "password": "user1pass"
}

### Login 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user1@gmail.com",
    "password": "user1pass"
}